    "notes": "Canvas = one InstancedMesh: 32x24 picture pixels extruded per RELIEF (extra cubes start coincident at z=0 and step out in whole cubes) + a 2-deep wood frame ring. Colour at step k = lerp(noise_k, blockAverage_k(target), 1-(1-k/20)^5); per-pixel step switches along a diagonal wave with a split-flap flip (steps 1-3) or a scale dip (4-20). All AO is recomputed from snapped cube positions each frame."
